883 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (____NDC3.0  integrates adaptation, giving priority attention to water resources and agriculture, energy, infrastructure and cities, forest ecosystems and biodiversity, health care and disaster risk management, operationalising the National Adaptation Plan \(NAP\) through sectoral objectives. )
/E (____NDC3.0  integrates adaptation, giving priority attention to water resources and agriculture, energy, infrastructure and cities, forest ecosystems and biodiversity, health care and disaster risk management, operationalising the National Adaptation Plan \(NAP\) through sectoral objectives. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
884 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (____NDC3.0 emphasises inclusiveness: the active involvement of women, children, youth, and vulnerable groups in both the planning and implementation of measures through training, local projects, and participation mechanisms. It also highlights the need to expand public oversight and monitoring at local levels, as well as to strengthen operational preparedness for Emergency Situations \(ES\), including early warning systems, rapid access to assistance, and assessment of damages and losses.)
/E (____NDC3.0 emphasises inclusiveness: the active involvement of women, children, youth, and vulnerable groups in both the planning and implementation of measures through training, local projects, and participation mechanisms. It also highlights the need to expand public oversight and monitoring at local levels, as well as to strengthen operational preparedness for Emergency Situations \(ES\), including early warning systems, rapid access to assistance, and assessment of damages and losses.)
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
endobj
