/T (____Therefore, NDC3.0 emphasizes adaptation as a cross-cutting policy \(covering water, health, cities and infrastructure, agriculture, and mountain ecosystems\), while maintaining mitigation commitments but prioritizing resources, planning, and monitoring around the protection of people and livelihoods.)
