<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (____The NDC3.0 sets the following adaptation goal for forests and biodeversity: to conserve and restore forest ecosystems and biodiversity, ensure sustainable management of natural resources, and enhance the adaptive capacity of communities under climate change.)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 557 0 R
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
