/S /P
/P 4205 0 R
/E (The risks of non-implementation or partial implementation of measures whose deadlines fall in the subsequent reporting period.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2549 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (____The Ministry of Natural Resources, Ecology and Technical Supervision of the Kyrgyz Republic, as the state body responsible for the development, implementation and coordination of climate policy, will carry out the following functions:)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [8]
>>
