/P 4292 0 R
/E (The NDC targets for 2035 and 2030 are set to achieve high level of ambition, building on current and including new actions, policies, measures and investments, to utilize large part of the mitigation potential that is available across all sectors of economy. This will allow to achieve unconditional total net GHG emission reduction below the BAU scenario of 18% in 2030 and 16% in 2035. This is equivalent to absolute emission reduction of 3.3 Mt CO2eq in 2030 and 3.9 Mt CO2eq in 2035.)
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
